{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10284220","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10284220","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1028422001:1":{"text":"これは採集部隊のとはまったく違う足跡です！別の誰かのものです！","source_cn":"这里的脚印，和采集队成员的脚印完全不同！是另一种足迹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F661CE83F66DA58","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1028422002:1":{"text":"一人は歩幅が大きく、がに股気味です。もう一人は歩幅が小さく、ヨロヨロとしています……","source_cn":"一个人步伐很大，走路有点外八字；另一个似乎步伐比较小，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AEDB3BF5E688DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1028422002":{"text":"一人は歩幅が大きく、がに股気味です。もう一人は歩幅が小さく、ヨロヨロとしています……","source_cn":"一个人步伐很大，走路有点外八字；另一个似乎步伐比较小，感觉走得踉踉跄跄的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x90AEDB3BF5E688DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028422003:2":{"text":"変ですね。二人の足跡がここで消えています……戻った跡も、他の場所へ向かった形跡もありません。","source_cn":"奇怪，他们的脚印在这里消失了……没有往回走，也没有去别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA45A004A5D0C0BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028422004:1":{"text":"モンスターに追い詰められて、木の上によじ登ったんじゃないでしょうか？","source_cn":"难道被怪物追赶，到这里无路可跑，所以不得不爬到了树上！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE175B9B300447E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1028422005:1":{"text":"おーい！！上に誰かいますか？","source_cn":"喂——上面——有人吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAEF7D205B81C9247","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028422006:1":{"text":"それはなさそうです。木の幹に生えている苔はきれいなままで、踏んだり登ったりしたような跡はありませんから。","source_cn":"不对，树干上的青苔都很完整，没有被踩踏或者蹭掉的痕迹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83A1DE4E6B26EAC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028422007:2":{"text":"……いったいどこへ行ってしまったのでしょう？","source_cn":"……他们究竟去了哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207F48A4A06FA641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028422007":{"text":"……いったいどこへ行ってしまったのでしょう？","source_cn":"……他们究竟去了哪里呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x207F48A4A06FA641","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028422008:0":{"text":"はっきり言えることは、人は訳なく突然消えたりしないということです！","source_cn":"漫漫能肯定，人是不会凭空消失的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03150FDD8E618AF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_